---
description: >-
  Requirement diagram covering a requirement and an element styled via classDef
  + `class` statement, rendered under the "neo" look with the "neo" theme.
config:
  look: neo
  theme: neo
---
requirementDiagram
    requirement req_a {
        id: 1
        text: req A.
        risk: low
        verifymethod: analysis
    }
    element elem_a {
        type: module
    }
    elem_a - refines -> req_a
    classDef bold font-weight:bold
    classDef blue stroke:lightblue,color:#0000FF
    class req_a bold
    class elem_a blue,bold
